      "  N=17: M=0.998, 95%CI=[0.997,0.999] ← stable (Δ<0.005)\n",
      "  N=18: M=0.999, 95%CI=[0.999,0.999] ← stable (Δ<0.005)\n",
      "  Stabilization point (Δ<0.005): N = 13\n",
